uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1929634835077599_7317223424650964347_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K7gOAGr2XwsQ7kNvwHigGT7&_nc_oc=AdqZxI2aRcE5cY1eO64CQjYIAzPzehfoQIfRYCKkuNYM0GHohXJgVpJJqOlJpp2vRuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRDTyiKLFxmXonNqHbAr7JCWKJDn6LKvQ2QC1OmVN7dOg&oe=6AF71627"}, "display_name": "RC Brains: Drift Update", "keywords": ["racing", "socialvr", "rccars", "vehicles", "mechs"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfc1 THE DRIFT UPDATE IS HERE \ud83c\udfc1\n\n\nRC Brains is a chaotic Social VR playground where you play as a Brain, jump into RC vehicles, and race, fly, crash, explore, and hang out with friends.\n\n**Join the Community=>** https://discord.gg/rcbrains\n \n\n \n# DRIVE RC CARS IN VR\n{3874153959558303}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n# FLY RC DRONES & PLANES IN VR\n{3744554712353768}\n{2225960998146844}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n\n# BECOME THE BRAIN\n{4300031590325704}\n\nJump into RC vehicles, hang out with friends, and create funny moments across the playground.\n\nRace, fly, crash, earn rewards, and become the Brain everyone remembers.\n\n{1526593175742234}\n\n", "short_description": "Play as a Brain in a chaotic Social VR playground! Jump into RC cars, fly RC planes, hang out with friends, earn Brain Bits, and build your RESPECT!"}]}, "developer_name": "AshRift Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rcbrains-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IRONHEAD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sit